# Baseline reproduction — mgga_c_tpssloc compile (Task 1)

**Date:** 2026-05-19/20 (session straddling midnight)
**Command:** `/usr/bin/time -v cargo build -p libxc-kernel-mgga_c_tpssloc`
**Working tree:** dirty (`.cargo/config.toml` has `jobs` commented out → cargo uses default `num_cpus` parallelism, but `-p libxc-kernel-mgga_c_tpssloc` builds only one crate so only one rustc process is active for tpssloc)
**Deps cache state at start:** cubecl-core + libxc-kernel-math + 660 other dependency crates already cached; only tpssloc itself needed compilation.

